From 3a50a0a57eb69e91c4d3ce4b2a0952f7d0a5ae1e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: T3chnobone <98963290+T3chnobone@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 14:21:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Support 8 controller ports, own-aspect framebuffers and
 spanning windows

- MAXCONTROLLERS 4 -> 8 (input editor shows all ports; new gamepads are
  ignored on ports 2-8 until assigned).
- Framebuffers with an explicit pixel size and their own aspect ratio
  (gfx_set_framebuffer_pixel_size), for split views of any shape.
- Window API: GetMonitorRects() and SetBorderless(), implemented for the
  SDL2 and DXGI backends, for a window spanning several monitors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qq7B1uqfWVWykYRDDMiuXa
